             "Updated version of pDockQ (pDockQ2) with improved calibration "
             "for AF2/AF3 predictions. Generally more reliable than pdockq "
             "for ranking binding quality.",
             "0-1. Higher is better. > 0.15 promising"],
            ["lis",
             "Local Interaction Score. Measures the predicted quality of "
             "local contacts at the binding interface. Sensitive to interface "
